<title>USA: Burr-Brown sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Burr-Brown sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burr-Brown Corp on Tuesday said it declared a 3-for-2 stock distribution in which stockholders will receive one additional share for every two shares they own.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be paid in cash, said the company, which makes integrated circuits for processing electronic signals.</p>
<p>The distibution is payable April 8 to shareholders of record March 18.</p>
